---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy">
  <section class="policy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>How this site measures performance</h1>
    <p>This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand page views and how quickly pages load. It does not use Google Analytics.</p>
    <h2>What Cloudflare Web Analytics does</h2>
    <p>The analytics beacon reports page and referrer information together with performance measurements such as page-load timing and Core Web Vitals. It does not use cookies, local storage, or other browser storage to recognise you between visits.</p>
    <p>Cloudflare receives the analytics request in order to provide this service. Cloudflare states that it discards the source IP address at the nearest data centre and does not store it in its core databases or logs.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Because this analytics implementation does not store or access information on your device, this site does not show a cookie-consent banner. You can use browser content blockers if you prefer not to load the analytics beacon.</p>
    <p>Read <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Cloudflare’s Privacy Policy</a> and its <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/speed/observatory/rum-beacon/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Web Analytics privacy documentation</a> for more information.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
